<title>INDIA: India's Adani Exports 96/97 net rises.</title>
<headline>India's Adani Exports 96/97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     536.7  vs     402.7</p>
<p>    Sales		 16,068.2  vs  11,346.5</p>
<p>    Div (in percent)	30    vs	 N.A</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    15.9  vs	 8.21</p>
<p>    Tax			  2.5  vs	 0.22</p>
<p>NOTE: Adani Exports Ltd is one of India's largest trading houses. The company said it expects to increase its volume of trade after the completion of a jetty project that is being built by its subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
